00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:51.077 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Oubliez donc les frictions entrt

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:52.112 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Zelensky, à cause de commentaire

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.146 size:53% position:73% line:53%
