00:01:53.480 --> 00:02:02.822 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Poutine. La relation seraitau b.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:03.856 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Dans les ruines de la ville

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:04.891 size:53% position:73% line:53%
